{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"尝过那份充实后，他这次更安心地靠近。此刻他觉得，自己仍握得住分寸。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他体验到，靠近这份渴望能带来满足，自己也仍能掌握投入的程度。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"贴近的亲密感与收敛的表达支持他逐渐安心的理解，而他仍能掌握分寸是合理但尚未完全证实的推断。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选4\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"这回他对靠近有了更切身的忐忑：先前尝到的充实，让他知道这份渴望足够诱人，可能慢慢牵住自己。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"这份渴望的吸引力变得更加具体，失去掌控的担忧也随之加深。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"轻柔表达中的迟疑与隐约惆怅允许这种解读，且先前的满足确实能使失控的担忧更具体，但这一段并未明确表现出恐惧占据主导。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选5\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d284aa33-0d7d-4572-a323-8a048884035b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T032850871471Z", "elapsed_seconds": 84.422, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T03:30:15.307231+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2ad691f053c0bd1370ae33ba238e8c99bf9ef183adfad66f6de3231a9b62b950", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0